  "gh:content": {
    "en": "Nei-chan smiles. “Salvation isn’t singular. When you called it ‘pain,’ I felt Elias’s wall soften. ‘Correctness’ alone left him breathless. His meme will find new connections and return to the flow. He’s a little freer of the fear of death now.”"
